        <entry>
          <string>Description</string>
          <string>Control Bit input, used by ALU

table:
X = RESERVED

Base BITS
b0     b1    b2     b3  b4     b5     b6 b7 b8
ADD SUB AND OR XOR NOT X    X   X

Extended BITS
b0     b1   b2     b3    b4     b5    b6 b7 b8
MUL DIV ROR ROL SHR SHL X	 X   X</string>
        </entry>
        <entry>
          <string>Label</string>
          <string>CONTROL BIT</string>
        </entry>
