          <string>Bits</string>
          <int>16</int>
        </entry>
      </elementAttributes>
      <pos x="400" y="560"/>
    </visualElement>
    <visualElement>
      <elementName>In</elementName>
      <elementAttributes>
        <entry>
          <string>Description</string>
          <string>Used to control the Status register inside the ALU

table:
X = RESERVED

Base BITS
b0 b1 b2 b3 b4 b5 b6 b7 b8
Zfl Nfl Cfl Ofl X   X   X   X    X

Zfl 	: Zero Flag
Nfl 	: Negative Flag
Cfl	: Carry Flag
Ofl	: OverFlow Flag

Extended BITS
b0 b1       b2 b3 b4 b5 b6 b7 b8
Pfl INTfl   Dfl

Pfl	: Parity Flag
INTfl	: Interrupt Flag
Dfl	: Direction Flag (Used for barrel shifting)</string>
        </entry>
